WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.167
One phone.

2
00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:12.333
No SIM card, no data plan.

3
00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:18.500
And two live channels, all along the coast.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.667
Four high-power transmitters cover 120 kilometres.

5
00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:30.833
On the train, the picture holds at 110 kilometres an hour.

6
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:37.000
The next question is not technical: who will pay for a permanent service?
